Second, pillars x1–x6 are heavily correlated (r = .57–.88 across all pairwise combinations, as shown in @tbl-corr-ecosystem).
This is problematic in our case since it will create multicollinearity issues in the models and would compromise numerical stability, fit, and most likely bias the results.  

Thus, we retained pillars x8-x14 that show higher heterogeneity and more moderate pairwise correlations.
Regardless, the pillars we retain (see @tbl-gei-pillars) are more informative for our case since they capture the institutional landscape of entrepreneurial ecosystem which is our main area of focus in this work.


