### Region level variables {#sec-emp-region-vars}

For the spatial panel (H5),  we aggregate the dyadic variables to region–year means.
Specifically we retain average coherence, average betweenness, and average eigenvector of each region's existing portfolio.
Additionally, we also aggregate patent counts to the total regional patenting activity across all technologies and keep regional complexity.
Each of these variables reflect an aggregate characteristic of the regional technological portfolio.
Further descriptive details on these variables are presented in @tbl-desc-panel and @tbl-corr-regional.



